{
  "title": "7th Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَعِنِّیْ فِیْهِ عَلٰی صِیَامِهٖ وَ قِیَامِهٖ \nALLAAHUMMA A-I’NNEE FEEHE A’LAA SEYAAMEHI WA QEYAAMEHI \nO Allah, help me therein (in this month) to fast and to stand (in prayer). \nوَ جَنِّبْنِیْ فِیْهِ مِنْ هَفَوَآتِهٖ وَ اٰثَامِهٖ \nWA JANNIBNEE FEEHE MIN HAFAWAATEHI WA AASAAMEHI \nAnd keep me away therein from its slips and its sins, \nوَارْزُقْنِیْ فِیْهِ ذِكْرَكَ بِدَوَامِهٖ \nWAR ZUQNEE FEEHE ZIKRAKA BEDAWAAMEHI \nAnd grant me therein Your constant remembrance, \nبِتَوْفِیْقِكَ یَاهَادِیَ الْمُضَالِّیْنَ.\nBE-TAWFEEQEKA YAA HAADEYAL MOZILLEENA.\nBy Your grace, O Guide of those who go astray."
}
